<title>PORTUGAL: Pre-opening trade in BPSM cancelled.</title>
<headline>Pre-opening trade in BPSM cancelled.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lisbon bourse cancelled transactions in Banco Pinto &amp; Sotto Mayor in the pre-opening session, the bourse said on Monday.</p>
<p>Trade in BPSM shares was interrupted temporarily on the bourse. The reason for the interruption was not immediately known.</p>
<p>BPSM shares hit a 1997 high of 1,298 escudos.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +3651-1-3538254</p>
</text>
